    depositRules: "Register on the Clerk online auction site (no registration fee). Advance deposit = greater of 5% of maximum intended bid or $200. ACH online deposits must be submitted at least three full business days before the auction; or cash/official bank check/cashier's check to Tax Deeds by 4:00 p.m. the day before. Final payment by 2:00 p.m. the next business day (cash, official bank check, cashier's check, or wire — not ACH/personal check). Forfeiture triggers re-auction within 30 days.",
    taxCollector: { label: "Palm Beach County Tax Collector", url: "https://www.pbctax.gov/" },
