    auctionFrequency: "Annually in May (2026: May 11); Assignment Sale of unsold certificates afterward",
    depositRules: "Non-refundable $150 registration fee + $1,000 deposit (deposit applied to certificates; refunded if none awarded). 2026 registration window April 10–24; W-9 required by 5:00 p.m. EST April 24. Successful bidders must wire full amount due (including high bid premium) by 4:00 p.m. EST the day after the sale (May 12, 2026 for 2026 cycle). Non-payment voids awards and can bar future participation.",
    taxCollector: { label: "Prince George's County Office of Finance — Tax Sale", url: "https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/finance/services/tax-sale" },
