    depositRules: "Pre-register at Treasurer’s office (320 Robert S. Kerr Ave. #307, Oklahoma City). Cash/trust deposits accepted during pre-registration; day-of registration often opens ~7:30 a.m. at sale site. Payment in full expected when bidding; exact deposit minimum and accepted instruments posted for each cycle on the Treasurer site / resale list (docs.oklahomacounty.org/treasurer).",
