    survivingLiens: "Sheriff's sale deeds are not automatic free-and-clear tax deeds. Junior liens may be extinguished depending on the execution type, but senior liens, federal tax liens, and certain municipal claims can survive. Independent title search required before bidding.",
    quietTitle: "Often needed before marketable title insurance on sheriff-sale purchases, especially where notice defects or residual claims exist; consult Pennsylvania counsel.",
