    depositRules: "Bid4Assets deposit required before bidding. Recent RES tax-title sales used a single $300 deposit + $35 non-refundable processing fee (vesting info required first). Older Treasury foreclosure cycles used $2,500 + $35 — confirm deposit amount on the specific storefront for the sale you are entering. Full payment by posted settlement deadline (typically ~48 hours+).",
