    notes: "Ohio tax foreclosure + mortgage foreclosure now fully online via Lucas County Sheriff RealAuction (lucas.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov) effective March 12, 2026 — no in-person courthouse tax sales. Tax foreclosure auctions monthly on dates set by the court. Auditor also runs annual Forfeited Land Sale for parcels not sold at sheriff sale (e.g. Dec 2025 cycle). Treasurer offers a Foreclosure Request Program ($5,000 deposit per parcel) for eligible purchasers to advance specific delinquencies to sale.",
