    notes: "Notable exception among larger OH counties: Stark's tax CERTIFICATE sale moved online via RealAuction in 2023 and IS retail-accessible. A separate in-person sheriff sale also exists for tax-delinquent real estate foreclosures at the County Fairgrounds Arts Hall.",
