    depositRules: "Pre-register on GovEase per sale terms; review Bucks Rules for Upset and Judicial Sales PDF. Upset prices are approximate and can change as liens post. Payment, transfer taxes, and Act 33 certification requirements are enforced at settlement — read current Conditions of Sale before bidding.",
